Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.84,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:13.54,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.64,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The flow may shallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,780,,{\b1\i1\c&HFFB100&\1a&H00&}It is a time when the internet spans the world{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,650,,{\b1\i1\c&HFFB100&\1a&H00&}and even though consciousness {\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,510,,{\b1\i1\c&HFFB100&\1a&H00&}has been transformed into light and electrons\N{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,385,,{\b1\i1\c&HFFB100&\1a&H00&}all flowing in a single direction{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,240,,{\b1\i1\c&HFFB100&\1a&H00&}discrete individuals have not yet{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,90,,{\b1\i1\c&HFFB100&\1a&H00&}coalesced into a single consciousness{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:58.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The device to inject sleeping gas into the air conditioning\Nsystem is now installed between the outer wall and the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger... Set it to 0-2-2-0,\Nand wait for the sign....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:46.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you guys cops!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:49.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The system is no longer capable of justice...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't like this world,\Nchange yourself first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:55.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't like that idea, close your\Neyes and ears, keep your mouth shut, and live in solitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:58.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't like that either...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:05.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Call everyone, tell them to equip with A-2...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The location is 82-D3...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:08.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You hear that, Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:14.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, I'm listening...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:23.42,Default,,500,0,500,,{\b1\i1}Public Safety \NSection 9{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:47.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't hand over command without a good reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:48.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This case is under Police jurisdiction!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have no responsibility to explain it to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:54.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't be stubborn, just hand\Nover command to the military...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:56.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Same to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is this time to be selfishly quarreling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:03.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aramaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:10.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The real problem is the customers inside, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:18.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The customers who believe to be captured\Nare: the Minister of Foreign Affairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The minister's secretary, the chairman of\Nthe minister's supporters organisation and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:24.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,two visitors from the North American\NIndustry Support Association...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:29.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's been 17 minutes since the\Ngeisha robots captured them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:36.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The hostess, who escaped on her own, said\Nthat two of them might have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:41.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Other than that, we don't have a clue of\Nthe situation inside the restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:44.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Any claim of responsibility or demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:45.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Not at this point...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Communication blockade?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:48.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Media blackout?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:54.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's been 9 minutes since we executed\NCode 1-4, it won't last long...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:57.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We, Public Safety Section 9, will\Nbe taking over this case now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Standby until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:01.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kubota...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:16.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Tell me why the army wants to be involved...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:18.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}One of our men is inside.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:21.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}I can't tell you more than that for now.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Alright, tell me about it later.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:25.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Leave it to me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:30.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:32.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Not yet!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The army wants to be involved...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:35.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Watch your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Thanks for the advice...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:37.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Batou!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:39.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Not yet!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:44.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}So that was the wiretap I heard when I was listening\Nin on the Sniping Group's communications...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:46.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa! Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, there are too many lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:53.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It'll take me at least 2 hours to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:57.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa! Go out to the courtyard,\Nand be ready to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Saitou!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:07.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Although I neutralised the image curtain,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:09.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}There are too many trees, so I\Ncan only do limited sniping...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:10.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pazu! Bouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:16.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Anytime{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:20.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}The guy who's controlling the\Nrobot geishas must be close,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:22.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Don't shoot the transmitter though.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:24.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Send the virus out before the\Nguy erases the evidence!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:29.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major! What if the robot\Ngeishas demand better working conditions?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Everyone stay put!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Stand-by OK!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:35.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good, strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:37.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Go!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:07.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pazu! Bouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:10.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Follow the hunting virus!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:11.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Batou support them!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Sounds great!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:18.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't space out Togusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:20.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Chief! We have the scene under control.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:23.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}One of the hostages needs emergency treatment...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:25.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's a severe external wound...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:30.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The other one, judging from the damage\Nto the head, is confirmed dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:33.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Batou and the others are pursuing the culprit.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:36.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good, guide the minister and the\Nrest out of the restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:38.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But be alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:42.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have the passage lighted and 4\Nwagons ready at the main entrance...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:44.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Move to alert level B-6
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:45.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:46.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Minister, can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:50.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah... thanks for helping me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:07.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Major! The target is a cyborg...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:08.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Cross-referencing records.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:09.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}No matches so far.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:13.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't kill him until we know\Nwhat he was waiting for...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:14.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Bouma! I'm going to catch up with you soon!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:17.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't jump out in front of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Do I look like a child?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Tachikoma! Are you following me?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What took you so long, Tachikoma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:47.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give up yet...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit... I might've screwed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:06.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:21.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, will you tell me the story, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:28.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, the minister's secretary, the\None shot in the head... was my subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:32.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She was under my command, and I ordered\Nher to make secret inquiries...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:34.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Inquiries about the minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:40.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, there seems to be some interest around\Nhim lately regarding the Ichinose Report...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:46.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The one that contains scenarios for diplomatic\Nand military tactics in an emergency, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:52.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, of course the army won't refuse if\Nthe minister wants us to release it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:56.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But it wasn't the minister\Nhimself who ordered it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.45,0:10:58.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And we managed to stall them until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:02.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The inquiry was what you'd call a\Nconfirmation of safety, just normal business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then why was she shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:11.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hm? She might have been erased\Nbecause she knew something...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:14.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How did the Minister's background check out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I looked into it briefly but nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:20.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He wasn't being threatened and there was\Nno unusual activity in his account either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:25.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now I'm screwed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:29.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If it's okay with you, I was thinking\Nabout taking on this case...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Great...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:35.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But don't do anything that will\Nleave a scar on your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to take full\Nresponsibility if you should fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:51.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:54.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Check up on out those around the\NMinister for anything unusual and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:58.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,find out exactly what was going\Non inside the restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:01.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will look into the relationship between\Nthe army and the Ichinose Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:04.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh? Isn't he your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:07.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course, that's why I'm the\None who's investigating it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:26.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Erasing his own memory... He sure has guts...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:29.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There might have been side-effects on his brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:33.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And I'm being laughed at by everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A waste of money, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:57.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you're going to bother with shooting practice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:59.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I recommend that you get an artificial body...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:02.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you saying I should become a cyborg?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:08.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not stupid enough to mix orders\Nfor work-related and private matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:12.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think your shooting back\Nthere was pretty good, but
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you thought Ur armour piercing bullets\Nwere going to hit the hostages,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:17.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you should have dealt with it\Naccording to the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:21.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You did have your 9mm pistol with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:27.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why do you think I pulled\Nyou out of central office?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:31.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you think it's better to try and contribute by\Ndoing what you're good at instead of being depressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:39.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to closely examine what was going\Non for the ten-odd minutes before our strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:07.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How's your grandson?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:09.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Boy you're impatient...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:20.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Ichinose Report won't affect\Nthe army in any financial way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:22.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's nothing you would be interested in either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.10,0:14:25.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Government or Administration, who's idea was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:29.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Soldiers who would lose out because of it\Naren't in a position to know about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:34.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Don't search for what you don't\Nknow, it's safer..." your words...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You haven't changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:41.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's a new restaurant with good shrimp...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:42.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:44.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Maybe next time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The major is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:14:59.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:03.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The picture of the "Willow"\Nroom right after the incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:07.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the video from the camera\Ninside the restaurant both bug me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:24.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This man was supposed to have a spinal unit made\Nfor him by the North American Neutron Company...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:29.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, when we put all the parts together,\Nit turned out they couldn't be reassembled into the original one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:34.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The next image is the foreign minister\Nand a geisha in front of the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:36.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,With a geisha?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:40.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, it seems that he was drunk and having\Nfun switching bodies with a geisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:49.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's the visitor from the\NNorth American Industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:50.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Does he "play" too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:54.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I didn't find any images of what\Nwas going on inside the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:02.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here comes his secretary, all\Nworried about the minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:07.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's where the secretary was attacked...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is different than what\Nthe other visitor told us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:23.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He said the visitor was\Nattacked before the secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:27.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The chairman was pretty drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:31.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but he told us he thought he heard\Nthe secretary's scream first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:34.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did the secretary see...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}What did she see...?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:02.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Minister, can you walk?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:05.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:32.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Major! You said the minister liked to\Nswitch bodies with geishas, right?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:33.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Yeah, so?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:36.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What if the minister had his brain core switched?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:39.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If they wanted the Ichinose Report,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.65,0:17:44.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}They would need the minister's body, his looks...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.10,0:17:48.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The secretary must have witnessed the\Nminister's brain being switched...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:49.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kubota! This is Aramaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:57.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,About the Minister of Foreign Affairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:01.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The minister was here with the visitors from the\NNorth American Industry Support Association...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:04.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They took the Ichinose Report with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:09.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They have the encoded version, so that\Nmight buy us a little time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:11.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where is the minister now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:13.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's on his way to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:16.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's going to give a speech at the party for the\NNorth American Industry Support Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:17.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard he's flying to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.50,0:18:19.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Batou! Equip with L-2 it's an emergency!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After picking up Togusa and Saitou,\Nwe'll head to the airport!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:44.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:49.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're very sorry, your private plane has been\Ndelayed 15 minutes late due to bad weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:18:59.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:33.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:38.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry for the delay, your jet is ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:52.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please, hold it right there Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:59.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, it's you! Thank you for the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:07.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was sent here to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:09.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:18.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To recuperate from illness, I\Nwill resign from office...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:21.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Me? What's this about appointing my successor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.85,0:20:25.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now that you have read that document,\Nyou are no longer a minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:27.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:28.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What authority do you have!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:33.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From the Prime Minister, along with the\NGovernment party, this is an official matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you want to, go ahead and confirm it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:39.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Assemblyman, you are suspected of spying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:43.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and of attempting political asylum\Nin a foreign country.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:45.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please come with us to the station...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:46.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:48.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:53.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is not the minister you should be guarding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:12.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have the brain core secured...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:21.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You have a lot of explaining\Nto do about who you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:22.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take him away...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:58.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's going to have an operation, to have her brain\Nsupported by Cyberbrain technology and micro-machines...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:04.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's going to be some impairment in her speech centre,\Nbut nothing that would be a difficulty in everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:06.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:12.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This case... it's a shame we couldn't\Nsolve it, but thanks for everything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:21.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Right after the incident, if you didn’t hold out, the police would\Nhave gone in, shot the robots, and thought matters were settled...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:27.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Section 9 wouldn't have been involved, and by now, the media would be\Nin panic about the Minister of Foreign Affairs spying and in exile...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:33.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I still can't believe you got the papers needed\Nto persuade a politician in such a short time...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:37.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's like they say, always be prepared...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.90,0:22:42.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There was no bad weather,\Nand the plane came late...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.00,0:22:45.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is Public Safety Section 9...
